# OpenDM Authors and Maintainers

OpenDM is an open-source, clean-room native Linux recreation of Internet Download Manager (IDM).

## Creator & Lead Developer
* **Nader Mahbub Khan**
  * GitHub: [@nadermkhan](https://github.com/nadermkhan)
  * Email: muhammadnadermahbubkhan@gmail.com
  * Role: Original Author, System Architecture & Core Engine

## Fork Maintainer (GTK3 fork)
* **FA Saikat**
  * GitHub: [@fa-saikat](https://github.com/fa-saikat)
  * Repository: https://github.com/fa-saikat/opendm
  * Role: GTK3 port, distribution packaging (deb/rpm/Arch), CI and release automation

This fork is a modified version of OpenDM and is not the official upstream project.

